#. Diagram label
msgid "Read the guide's own stated rules"
msgstr ""

#: processes/ui/ingest-theme.bpmn:68
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Read the ROLE, never the prettiest value. Bootstrap's --blue is a scale entry and --primary is the role; DSpace sets them differently, and taking the brand-looking one is the hardcoding schemas/ui/theme.ts exists to end. Column widths come from declared columns, never from breakpoints: a breakpoint is a viewport."
msgstr ""

